              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മുറി (muṟi) — \"a room\". ഇത് എന്റെ മുറി — \"this is my room\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "മുറി (muṟi) is native Dravidian, one word with Tamil muṟi and Kannada muṟi (DEDR 5008). Its first sense is \"a piece, a fragment\": a room is a part cut off from a house."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
